WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.267
Cybersecurity training. Module 6. AI tools and your data.

2
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:13.133
Anything you type or upload into an AI tool leaves your control and goes to the company that runs it.

3
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:18.033
You paste text, upload a file or record audio.

4
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:21.233
It travels to the company's systems.

5
00:00:21.567 --> 00:00:27.233
It may be stored, reviewed by people, or exposed if the company is breached.

6
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:32.267
A tool named in your client's instructions is approved.

7
00:00:32.633 --> 00:00:36.033
So is a tool ERS has approved in writing.

8
00:00:36.367 --> 00:00:40.500
A free account you made yourself is not approved.

9
00:00:40.833 --> 00:00:44.400
Nor is a tool a coworker recommended.

10
00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:47.333
Read it all. Do not skim.

11
00:00:47.667 --> 00:00:51.367
Check the facts against the source in the client's system.

12
00:00:51.733 --> 00:00:54.100
Remove anything that should not be there.

13
00:00:54.433 --> 00:00:58.767
Own it. What you send is your work, whoever drafted it.

14
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:00.767
Pause.

15
00:01:01.167 --> 00:01:02.000
Verify.

16
00:01:02.367 --> 00:01:03.467
Report fast.

17
00:01:03.867 --> 00:01:05.600
Now read the module.
